      "writtenOn": "2026-11-03T06:46:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027ve added a check to ensure that regData.length \u003c\u003d regData.data.size() before computing begin() + regData.length. The check runs on all entries before any register is written, so an invalid image is rejected without partially programming the device.",
      "parentUuid": "21834bda_4910e3b1",
